    feat(account): story 8.5 — account deletion

    Adds the "Apagar conta" destructive confirmation flow (DELETE /account)
    and finalizes story 8.4's own post-review patches that were sitting
    uncommitted in the tree.

    - ConfirmationDialog gains confirmButtonColor + cancelLabel/onCancel
      (paired-params assert) for destructive two-button confirms; AppButton
      gains a primary-variant backgroundColor override — both reused by the
      new "Apagar sua conta?" dialog (red title/confirm, Cancelar outline).
    - AccountSettingsRepository/_Impl/AccountRemoteDataSource gain
      deleteAccount() (account-delete, {"confirmation": "DELETE"}).
